seg-30417c63c48e = LEO-PNT is positioning, navigation and timing (PNT) from satellites in low Earth orbit (LEO). The <c1/> kind simulates one or more LEO satellite passes over a user and works out the link budget band by band, next to the medium Earth orbit (MEO) GNSS (global navigation satellite system) satellites in view. The engine is <b>system-agnostic</b>: any constellation, any signal design and any band, written straight into a scenario. Named systems are optional presets, each in its own file with its source.

